0..75 Comment "// A handler over a theory: the scope takes `State` as its interface, fixes"
76..150 Comment "// the stored sort `S` at `Integer` where it names the theory, and answers"
151..218 Comment "// each operation by a clause, or names a model of the theory whose"
219..294 Comment "// operations answer them, or leaves that to the one model of the theory in"
295..372 Comment "// scope. The carrier `C` is what the scope answers; `get` replies an integer"
373..441 Comment "// to its continuation, and `put` sends one and is replied the unit."
443..465 Comment "// The theory `State`."
466..472 Keyword "import"
473..474 StringLit "\""
474..487 StringLit "./state.gandr"
487..488 StringLit "\""
489..490 Other ";"
